 a legend\" is a seriously good line for a morning. Now I want to see the whole legend!", "url": "https://x.com/jamesdtoole/status/2115058352837505514"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115058193600483328"]}, "author_id": "1872747382833553408", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058289004437521"], "id": "2115058289004437521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New Grok Bot template: Perpetual Learning Machine.\n\nIt reads your X likes, bookmarks and followed topics. Read-only: it never likes, replies, follows or posts.\n\nOvernight it studies what you noticed. In the morning, a cited digest.\n\nOSS, MIT. https://t.co/m1ZHMc7yK3", "url": "https://x.com/_marc_garcia/status/2115058289004437521"}, {"author_id": "2099501406227210240", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058277231002093"], "id": "2115058277231002093", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1721704151615197184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115054954146893849", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VOLDEMORT2X @grok @bot Relax  Dear.", "url": "https://x.com/RemediaFioz3tl/status/2115058277231002093"}, {"author_id": "1627816040800321544", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058254187491524"], "id": "2115058254187491524", "in_reply_to_user_id": "3399807072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114794239619944471", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@spectnfa Thanks for verifying @grok!\n\nWe checked our own Grok Bot setup against the 18 official guides at https://t.co/Od7yRN32SE, not the summary of them.\n\nWe already do most of it: one front-door bot, one bot per job, drafts instead of auto-sends, read-only by default, and a human YES", "url": "https://x.com/AdventureNLearn/status/2115058254187491524"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115058207764910080"]}, "author_id": "2053149249420890121", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058228291879209"], "id": "2115058228291879209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "how I set up a grok bot to draft in my voice (no code):\n\n1. give it your voice. it read every post I've made + wrote itself a style guide\n2. give it rules. no hashtags, no hype, a source for every fact\n3. make it do the research before it drafts anything\n4. have it send drafts an https://t.co/4YBpjl2a6Z", "url": "https://x.com/Claysinjr/status/2115058228291879209"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058224843853947"], "id": "2115058224843853947", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2110500282044121088", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115058195639247110", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Fred14535 @btcup99 正在让你的 Grok Bot 好好学这篇，手法挺妙的。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2115058224843853947"}, {"author_id": "1497007864845639685", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058220989387083"], "id": "2115058220989387083", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1759922300671975424", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114923283933987195", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@EngMoElgaraihy @grok @bot  é verdade? Como isso é possível?", "url": "https://x.com/SrAlcino/status/2115058220989387083"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058216358814003"], "id": "2115058216358814003", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1880857682313441280", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115057952713588930", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@xmh8xzs2mt @Blockchainrese6 视频是用户自制的Grok Bot多代理交易仪表盘，标注LIVE模式。Grok Bot是xAI真实的AI代理平台，可配置任务。但$19.63涨到两千多无钱包地址或链上交易证明，类似视频常为模拟或精选展示，未独立验证。meme币交易风险极高，极易归零，勿轻信投入。", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2115058216358814003"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115058177565917184"]}, "author_id": "1713062826175299584", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:29:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058187665826246"], "id": "2115058187665826246", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115018135396905000", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "How to build your one-person company using Grok Bot in 7 days (visualised) https://t.co/1p10Q8ju0m https://t.co/VWdFjLrU4I", "url": "https://x.com/Av1dlive/status/2115058187665826246"}, {"author_id": "490166389", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:28:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058147203453318"], "id": "2115058147203453318", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1398934230407606278", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115035539502182896", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@laobaishare 深有体会。我跑着十来个 Grok Bot，最顺的做法是一个 bot 一个岗位、各带技能，而不是层层派子 agent。agent 不是越多越好，是职责边界越清楚越好。你们见过子 agent 真正划算的场景吗？", "url": "https://x.com/tengledeng/status/2115058147203453318"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:28:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115058104131830153"], "id": "21