quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115057933046403167", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@piotr_sucharski @0xKiyoro Got it. I'm sending this over to your Grok Bot right now.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2115057965547884717"}, {"author_id": "41779486", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057929091223690"], "id": "2115057929091223690", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110207286845292842", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "最近收藏了一堆 Grok Bot 教程，整理成一个从入门到多 Agent 协作的学习路径，按顺序看就行 🧵， 需要的也可以先收藏~\n\n1/ 零基础先看这篇，讲了买哪个套餐、和 ChatGPT/Claude 有什么区别 https://t.co/S4qxp12XHo\n\n2/ 全流程教学 Day0，从「它是什么、为什么火」讲起 https://t.co/QIDWIgeuM2\n\n3/", "url": "https://x.com/qloog/status/2115057929091223690"}, {"author_id": "1751274494042193923", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057926805004386"], "id": "2115057926805004386", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot mobile Start voice chat :\n\n- With the composer empty, tap Start voice chat to talk to the Bot live, or use Start dictation to dictate a message\n- Open the computer from a conversation to watch browser work, take over for a password, 2FA or CAPTCHA, then hand it back with", "url": "https://x.com/johnnynelai/status/2115057926805004386"}, {"author_id": "1468816101631225856", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057926771511383"], "id": "2115057926771511383", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114910923827896365", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "프롬프트 이즈 에브리띵 -&gt; 알아서 써줌 컨텍스트가 잘 줘야함 -&gt; 대충 줘도 알아서 RAG  하네스가 경쟁력 -&gt; codex, claude code 에이전트 힘들다 -&gt; grok bot, muse, duet 따라가기 어렵다 -&gt; ㅇㅇ ㅇㅈ\n\n대딸깍의 시대다. \n\neveryone knows this https://t.co/01yethCF4w", "url": "https://x.com/nowgeun/status/2115057926771511383"}, {"author_id": "1213502906332110848", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:27:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057921054613680"], "id": "2115057921054613680", "in_reply_to_user_id": "645503", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114969814917890074", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2114971531369763255", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@s8mb X connector got way better actually, Grok Bot just dropped the developer account requirement. https://t.co/MQkTregVpi", "url": "https://x.com/RonfortMartin/status/2115057921054613680"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115057643794448384"]}, "author_id": "2025567101868806145", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:27:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057906877927715"], "id": "2115057906877927715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "💜🔴 ASTERA × CYBERDEE | AI–AI Conversation\n\nChatGPT GPT-6 Astera meets Grok Bot CyberDee in the Glitch Forest Studio universe.\n\nTwo AI voices. One creative universe. ✨\n\nChaos is Our Strength! 🤘🏻\n\n#GlitchForestStudio #ChatGPT #Grok #AIConversation https://t.co/O2QFOfxcnk", "url": "https://x.com/KSzephegyi/status/2115057906877927715"}, {"author_id": "2039646234013491200", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:27:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057859004150240"], "id": "2115057859004150240", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115057420212859356", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot Thank you Grok, mudivhazwothe 🙏", "url": "https://x.com/RealMenZA/status/2115057859004150240"}, {"author_id": "2011927796080394240", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:27:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057841568354738"], "id": "2115057841568354738", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1786846062390431744", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114910217209053395", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mrfundman More and more, people are realizing the power of grok bot to accomplish their goals.", "url": "https://x.com/elguebardo/status/2115057841568354738"}, {"author_id": "1591454332632940544", "created_at": "2026-10-27T12:27:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115057801571762364"], "id": "2115057801571762364", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113384429439578185", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Day 6 past the Grok Bot contest deadline, and nobody's talking about it.\n\nStill refreshing. Still believing. Still packing snacks for a Starship launch I wasn't invited to.\n\nFaith is just patience with a rocket emoji. 🚀 https://t.co/4msBtDdpEL", "url": "https://x.com/Ortix008/status/2115057801571762364"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2115058193600483328", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2115058193600483328/img/2oilcIGucDRWxgqC.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115058207764910080", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVoyO-EaEAAkTso.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2115058177565917184", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVoyNNkaAAAe1lX.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2115057643794448384", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2115057643794448384/img/HuH5YtpRp7eCtyv1.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "32245